[{"text": "Minister for Foreign Affairs of", "start": 0.0, "duration": 4.839}, {"text": "Indonesia.", "start": 1.839, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I now give the floor", "start": 6.56, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "to His Excellency Mr. Leun Mella", "start": 10.16, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "Embella, Minister for Foreign Affairs of", "start": 14.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Cameroon.", "start": 17.76, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 20.72, "duration": 5.319}, {"text": "excellency", "start": 23.039, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": ">> [applause]", "start": 31.44, "duration": 2.02}, {"text": ">> Excellencies,", "start": 57.44, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 62.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "his excellency Paul Beia,", "start": 64.479, "duration": 8.561}, {"text": "President of the Republic of Cameroon,", "start": 67.6, "duration": 9.6}, {"text": "has bestowed upon me the immense honor", "start": 73.04, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "of", "start": 77.2, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "representing him in this encounter for", "start": 79.439, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "the 81st session of the United Nations", "start": 82.479, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "General Assembly", "start": 86.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and to", "start": 88.64, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "deliver the following statement on his", "start": 90.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "behalf.", "start": 93.759, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "I quote,", "start": 95.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "\"Mr. President,", "start": 98.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, heads of state and", "start": 100.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "government,", "start": 104.64, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, heads of", "start": 106.24, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "delegation,", "start": 108.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 109.68, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 113.2, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 115.759, "duration": 3.561}, {"text": "allow me to begin by", "start": 119.439, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "warmly", "start": 123.759, "duration": 3.121}, {"text": "congratulating", "start": 125.28, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "you on behalf of Cameroon for your", "start": 126.88, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "election to the presidency of this 81st", "start": 129.759, "duration": 8.601}, {"text": "session of the general assembly.", "start": 133.92, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "your eminent skill as a diplomat,", "start": 138.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "your knowledge", "start": 142.64, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "and", "start": 144.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "your wealth of experience when it comes", "start": 146.239, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "to United Nations issues as well as your", "start": 149.68, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "vision. The vision that you proposed for", "start": 153.76, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "our organization", "start": 156.8, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "are a good omen for", "start": 158.879, "duration": 10.0}, {"text": "the success of our work.", "start": 164.4, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "The delegation of Cameroon", "start": 168.879, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "through my voice would like to assure", "start": 171.519, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "you that you have our total and full", "start": 175.76, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "cooperation to ensure that your mandate", "start": 179.28, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "is a resounding success.", "start": 182.56, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "I would also like to welcome the work of", "start": 186.159, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "your predecessor,", "start": 190.159, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Madame Annelena Barbach", "start": 191.92, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "of the Federal Republic of Germany,", "start": 195.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "for", "start": 199.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the commitment and dynamic energy that", "start": 201.44, "duration": 8.879}, {"text": "she brought to her mission.", "start": 205.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "And", "start": 210.319, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "this is remarkable in a particularly", "start": 211.92, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "turbulent period for the international", "start": 215.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "arena. Finally, I would like to avail", "start": 218.319, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "myself of this occasion to reiterate to", "start": 221.44, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "the secretary general of the United", "start": 225.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Nations, Mr. Antonio Guterish", "start": 226.799, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Cameron's sincere esteem for his", "start": 230.56, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "constant commitment to the ideals,", "start": 234.879, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "purposes, and principles of the charter", "start": 239.2, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "of the United Nations,", "start": 242.159, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "as well as for his efforts and the", "start": 245.12, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "remarkable results that have", "start": 249.92, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "characterized his two consecutive", "start": 251.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "mandates as Secretary General of our", "start": 254.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "organization. ation.", "start": 256.959, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "We would like to welcome his courage", "start": 259.28, "duration": 9.44}, {"text": "and his tenacity in a context that often", "start": 263.199, "duration": 9.56}, {"text": "times has been difficult.", "start": 268.72, "duration": 4.039}, {"text": "He is preparing to leave his important", "start": 273.68, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "post in a few months and at this time", "start": 277.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Cameroon would like to thank him for his", "start": 280.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "unswerving commitment to the United", "start": 282.72, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Nations and we pay him a vibrant tribute", "start": 285.84, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "for the magnitude of his legacy. Mr.", "start": 290.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "President,", "start": 293.759, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "you decided", "start": 296.08, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "to", "start": 298.16, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "select", "start": 299.759, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "as a theme for this session restoring", "start": 301.52, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "trust,", "start": 304.16, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "managing transformation", "start": 306.56, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "form a united nations that delivers for", "start": 310.72, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "all.", "start": 315.28, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Cameon appreciates the relevance of this", "start": 318.32, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "theme and its pertinence for our current", "start": 322.479, "duration": 7.401}, {"text": "context.", "start": 326.88, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We are in effect facing together three", "start": 330.639, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "needs that cannot be teased apart.", "start": 336.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "First,", "start": 338.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "restoring trust among states.", "start": 340.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Second,", "start": 344.08, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "ensuring there is reconciliation", "start": 345.759, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "among peoples and nations with", "start": 348.4, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "multilateral institutions. And third,", "start": 351.52, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "working so that recent technological", "start": 356.88, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "progress benefits all humanity.", "start": 360.08, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "We are living in a time", "start": 364.88, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "where", "start": 368.08, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the progress of science and technology", "start": 369.759, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "have uh", "start": 373.68, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "allowed for useful knowledge to flourish", "start": 376.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "such as the emergence", "start": 379.039, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "of", "start": 381.84, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "artificial intelligence", "start": 383.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "in order to overcome the multiple", "start": 385.759, "duration": 8.841}, {"text": "challenges that humanity is facing.", "start": 389.28, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "In recent decades, we have adopted", "start": 395.039, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "agreements in different areas and we", "start": 398.479, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "continue to create the conditions for a", "start": 402.88, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "world that is more just, a world where", "start": 406.479, "duration": 11.081}, {"text": "we can all live in peace and security", "start": 410.96, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "despite our efforts. Nevertheless,", "start": 418.319, "duration": 9.361}, {"text": "wars and conflicts of all kinds persist.", "start": 422.16, "duration": 9.56}, {"text": "The arms race is intensifying.", "start": 427.68, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Humanitarian catastrophes,", "start": 432.24, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "selfishness,", "start": 434.8, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "and intolerance", "start": 436.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "are increasingly present.", "start": 438.56, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "And with impotence we watch the", "start": 442.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "deterioration of international", "start": 446.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "solidarity and multilateralism", "start": 448.96, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "as we see the appearance and", "start": 452.8, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "strengthening of different blocks that", "start": 456.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "are in confrontation", "start": 459.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "when certain challenges antagonize their", "start": 461.919, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "specific interest. President, the time", "start": 465.28, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "has come to return to the spirit and the", "start": 467.919, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "very basics of the United Nations", "start": 472.08, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "charter.", "start": 474.16, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "At the same time,", "start": 475.84, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "climate change is worsening and", "start": 479.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "constitutes", "start": 482.639, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "a concern at a planetary scale. Floods,", "start": 484.72, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "droughts,", "start": 488.879, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "and wildfires are recurring and do not", "start": 491.199, "duration": 10.201}, {"text": "spare any region in the world.", "start": 496.08, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "These climate events prevent many", "start": 501.599, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "populations from benefiting from the", "start": 504.96, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "marvelous technological progress that we", "start": 508.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "have made.", "start": 512.24, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "President,", "start": 514.08, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 516.479, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "in this situation, it is our collective", "start": 519.919, "duration": 8.001}, {"text": "duty to work together in order to", "start": 524.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "overcome these challenges and", "start": 527.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "effectively respond to the expectations", "start": 529.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "of our peoples.", "start": 532.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "And the United Nations offers us in this", "start": 535.839, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "case an ideal framework to engage in", "start": 539.2, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "discussions and find compromises, find", "start": 542.959, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "consensus in order to seek solutions to", "start": 547.44, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "these challenges that concern all of us.", "start": 551.68, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Cameroon is firmly committed to this", "start": 556.24, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "path and we support the UN80 initiative", "start": 559.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "as well as any other initiative that", "start": 563.36, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "could contribute to strengthening", "start": 566.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "cooperation and international", "start": 569.04, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "solidarity.", "start": 571.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Mr. President, excellencies, ladies and", "start": 573.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 576.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "the deadline for agenda 2030 is fast", "start": 579.76, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "approaching and we are able to observe", "start": 583.36, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "that despite remarkable efforts,", "start": 586.72, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "there is still a ways to go in order to", "start": 590.08, "duration": 9.68}, {"text": "reach the SDGs that we all chose for", "start": 594.64, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "ourselves", "start": 599.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and the resources is to reach the", "start": 602.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "sustainable development goals are", "start": 605.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "nevertheless available throughout the", "start": 607.279, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "world and therefore", "start": 609.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "we must improve the conditions to access", "start": 612.959, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "them and use these resources.", "start": 616.24, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "This is why financing for development", "start": 620.0, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "should not be considered as some kind of", "start": 623.68, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "alms or kindness. It is an investment in", "start": 628.079, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "stability,", "start": 631.6, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "shared prosperity", "start": 633.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "and collective security.", "start": 635.6, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "For this reason, Cameroon", "start": 639.839, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "calls for the diligent and comprehensive", "start": 643.279, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "implementation of the commitments made", "start": 647.68, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "in Seville in July of 2025 on the issue", "start": 650.959, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "of financing for development.", "start": 655.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "And this specifically implies engaging", "start": 658.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "in the necessary reforms of the", "start": 662.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "international financial architecture and", "start": 665.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "the multilateral financial architecture", "start": 667.68, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "in order to give countries of the global", "start": 670.399, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "south a more fair shot. We should also", "start": 674.64, "duration": 9.439}, {"text": "give new impetus to international trade,", "start": 679.519, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "industrialization", "start": 684.079, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "and", "start": 687.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "transforming raw materials locally as", "start": 689.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "well as strengthening regional", "start": 692.88, "duration": 5.079}, {"text": "integration.", "start": 694.959, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "And it is this energy that guided the", "start": 698.0, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "work of the 14th ministerial conference", "start": 702.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "of the World Trade Organization", "start": 705.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "WTO", "start": 709.12, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "which Cameroon had the privilege of", "start": 710.959, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "hosting from the 26th to the 29th of", "start": 712.959, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "March 2026.", "start": 716.24, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Cameroon also has the intention of", "start": 719.92, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "contributing to the full expansion of", "start": 722.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the", "start": 726.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "African continental free trade area. His", "start": 728.0, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "the acronym being AFCA.", "start": 731.92, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "We are one of the first countries in the", "start": 736.32, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "continent to have ratified its statute", "start": 739.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "in order to strengthen development and", "start": 742.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "trade cooperation among African", "start": 746.16, "duration": 6.679}, {"text": "countries. Moreover,", "start": 748.8, "duration": 4.039}, {"text": "my country reiterates its solidarity", "start": 754.48, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "when it comes to the African Union's", "start": 757.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "common position for better", "start": 761.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "representation of the African continent", "start": 763.36, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "in the United Nations Security Council.", "start": 766.48, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "My country also has the intention of", "start": 771.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "continuing to participate in", "start": 775.12, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "peacekeeping operations led by the", "start": 777.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "United Nations as well as", "start": 779.44, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "training and building capacities of um", "start": 782.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "African staff that serve in these", "start": 786.079, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "operations.", "start": 788.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "And in this regard,", "start": 790.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "I would like to welcome the stellar", "start": 792.72, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "cooperation that Cameroon has with the", "start": 796.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "United Nations in this area.", "start": 800.16, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "And I thus reaffirm the determination", "start": 803.12, "duration": 9.68}, {"text": "with which Cameroon will work along with", "start": 809.2, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "other member states of the Lake Chad", "start": 812.8, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Basin Commission. We will continue to", "start": 816.959, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "fight tirelessly against terrorism and", "start": 819.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "we will engage in stabilization efforts", "start": 821.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "in areas affected around the Lake Chad", "start": 824.079, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "region.", "start": 826.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "On a domestic level, the government of", "start": 829.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "my country is working to ensure a return", "start": 831.839, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "to normality in our northwest and", "start": 836.24, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "southwest regions.", "start": 840.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Our", "start": 843.519, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "government's efforts when it comes to", "start": 845.68, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "fighting insecurity and social", "start": 847.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "reintegration of those people that are", "start": 849.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "willing to set aside violence are", "start": 851.76, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "already delivering tangible and", "start": 854.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "observable results on the ground.", "start": 857.199, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "We should underline that the authorities", "start": 860.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "of Cameroon", "start": 863.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "have continued to multiply and", "start": 866.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "consolidate these results.", "start": 869.12, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "And I can assure you of Cameroon's", "start": 873.12, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "constant commitment to solidarity with", "start": 876.48, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "displaced populations,", "start": 881.44, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "refugees, and host communities.", "start": 884.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Despite", "start": 888.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "the multitude of um limitations", "start": 889.92, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "that affect these situations, Mr.", "start": 894.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "President,", "start": 897.199, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "in a world that is increasingly", "start": 899.68, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "unstable,", "start": 901.519, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "we have the duty to do everything", "start": 903.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "possible to create conditions that favor", "start": 905.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "peace, security,", "start": 908.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "and", "start": 911.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "stability of our international political", "start": 913.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "environment. In order to ensure", "start": 916.72, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "well-being for everyone,", "start": 919.68, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "we have the opportunity to do this.", "start": 923.279, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "Let's work together.", "start": 927.519, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Let's put our resources together in", "start": 930.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "order to overcome these common", "start": 933.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "challenges.", "start": 936.88, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Let's do this in order to respond to the", "start": 938.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "incessant calls of our populations who", "start": 941.76, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "aspire to live in a world of peace,", "start": 944.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "security, and prosperity", "start": 946.959, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "for current and future generations.", "start": 950.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "I thank you", "start": 955.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "for your very kind attention.\" End of", "start": 957.36, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "quote.", "start": 960.32, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I thank", "start": 980.48, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "the Minister for Foreign Affairs of", "start": 982.639, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "Cameroon.", "start": 984.639, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "We have now heard.", "start": 989.6, "duration": 2.799}]